\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Best $\ensuremath  {\mathrm  {tc}}$ reached in 90\,s of single-threaded annealing versus the memory target $\ensuremath  {\mathrm  {sc}_{\mathrm  {target}}}$ (median of three runs; whiskers span the range). The dashed line marks the converged frontier of Appendix~\ref {app:null}; the dotted vertical line marks the natural space cost of optimum-quality trees. The transition is a cliff at the natural value: every smaller target is comparably harmful, and every target at or above it, including $\ensuremath  {\mathrm  {sc}_{\mathrm  {target}}}=\infty $, reaches the frontier. The shipped default is $\ensuremath  {\mathrm  {sc}_{\mathrm  {target}}}=20$.}}{23}{figure.caption.32}\protected@file@percent }
